      "segments": [
        {
          "scene": "s01",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.3,
          "text": "Everyone says the one problem stopping a real"
        },
        {
          "scene": "s02",
          "start": 3.3,
          "end": 6.2,
          "text": "Iron Man suit is the arc reactor."
        },
        {
          "scene": "s03",
          "start": 6.2,
          "end": 8.8,
          "text": "I ran the numbers. It's not."
        },
        {
          "scene": "s04",
          "start": 8.8,
          "end": 12.1,
          "text": "The real problem is hovering. Hovering means pushing"
        },
        {
          "scene": "s05",
          "start": 12.1,
          "end": 15.8,
          "text": "your whole weight down through the air, every second."
        },
        {
          "scene": "s06",
          "start": 15.8,
          "end": 20.8,
          "text": "My suit burns about five kilograms of fuel a minute doing that."
        },
        {
          "scene": "s07",
          "start": 20.8,
          "end": 24.6,
          "text": "Flying forward on a wing burns less than one."
        },
        {
          "scene": "s08",
          "start": 24.6,
          "end": 26.3,
          "text": "That's five times less."
        },
        {
          "scene": "s09",
          "start": 26.3,
          "end": 36.2,
          "text": "So the fix isn't a better power source. It's wings. They swing back for speed, open wide to turn, and tilt up to brake."
        },
        {
          "scene": "s10",
          "start": 36.2,
          "end": 44.2,
          "text": "With wings, the same suit flies for about an hour when launched like a glider. The reactor can wait."
        },
        {
          "scene": "s11",
          "start": 44.2,
          "end": 47.1,
          "text": "Follow, and I'll show you the test."
        }
      ]
    },
